WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Enter the build token privately.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.800
The conversation receives a name, not a value.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:10.000
An authenticated localhost request. Build 184 passed.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.600
Inspect the token locally. It starts masked.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.800
Reveal only after confirmation.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.500
The example token is visible locally, then hidden.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Clear the vault. The token is no longer available.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Transcript hygiene, not a sandbox.
